WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'disk_avg_flush_time_ns_show' to 'avg_flush_time_ns_show' 'disk_avg_flush_time_ns_store' to 'avg_flush_time_ns_store'
